```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TechZone | Digital Studio</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f7fb;
            color: #222;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        /* NAVBAR */
        header {
            width: 100%;
            background: #111827;
            padding: 18px 7%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .logo {
            color: #00d4ff;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #00d4ff;
        }

        .menu-btn {
            display: none;
            color: white;
            font-size: 28px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .dark-btn {
            border: none;
            background: #00d4ff;
            padding: 9px 13px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* HERO */
        .hero {
            min-height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0066ff, #00d4ff);
            color: white;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 60px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: white;
            color: #0066ff;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 5px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
        }

        /* COMMON SECTION */
        section {
            padding: 80px 7%;
        }

        .title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 45px;
        }

        .title h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .title p {
            color: #666;
        }

        /* ABOUT */
        .about {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 50px;
        }

        .about-box {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .about-box h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .about-box p {
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .about-image {
            flex: 1;
            min-height: 300px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #0066ff);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 80px;
        }

        /* SERVICES */
        .services {
            background: #eef2ff;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 35px 25px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
        }

        .card {
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .service-page {
            min-height: 80vh;
            display: none;
            padding: 80px 7%;
            background: #f5f7fb;
        }

        .service-page.active-service {
            display: block;
        }

        .service-detail {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 45px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .service-detail .big-icon {
            font-size: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .service-detail h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .service-detail p {
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        body.dark .service-page {
            background: #0f172a;
        }

        body.dark .service-detail {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: white;
        }

        body.dark .service-detail p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 23px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* COMPLETE SERVICE DETAILS */
        .service-detail {
            max-width: 1000px;
        }

        .service-detail .detail-intro {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
        }

        .service-detail .detail-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 25px 0 30px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .service-detail .detail-item {
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            border-left: 4px solid #0066ff;
        }

        .service-detail .detail-item strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: #0066ff;
        }

        .service-detail .how-it-works {
            margin: 25px 0 30px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .service-detail .how-it-works h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 25px;
        }

        .service-detail .how-it-works ol {
            padding-left: 25px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        .service-detail .back-btn {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        body.dark .service-detail .detail-item {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        body.dark .service-detail .detail-item strong {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .service-detail .detail-list {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        /* CONTACT */
        .contact-container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .contact-form {
            background: white;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        .input-box {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .input-box label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .input-box input,
        .input-box textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 13px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            outline: none;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .input-box textarea {
            height: 130px;
            resize: none;
        }

        .submit-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            background: #0066ff;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 17px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            background: #004dcc;
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        footer .social {
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        footer a {
            color: #00d4ff;
            margin: 0 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* LOGIN POPUP */
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 2000;
        }

        .login-box {
            width: 380px;
            max-width: 90%;
            background: white;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .login-box h2 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .close {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            right: 18px;
            font-size: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* THEME TRANSITION */
        body,
        .card,
        .contact-form,
        .service-detail,
        .service-page,
        .services,
        .input-box input,
        .input-box textarea {
            transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        body.dark .card h3,
        body.dark .service-detail h2,
        body.dark .about-box h2,
        body.dark .title h2 {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        body.dark footer {
            background: #020617;
        }

        /* DARK MODE */
        body.dark {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
        }

        body.dark .title p,
        body.dark .about-box p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        body.dark .services {
            background: #111827;
        }

        body.dark .card,
        body.dark .contact-form {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: white;
        }

        body.dark .card p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        body.dark .input-box input,
        body.dark .input-box textarea {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
            border-color: #475569;
        }


        /* JAVASCRIPT PAGE NAVIGATION */
        .page {
            display: none;
        }

        .page.active-page {
            display: block;
        }

        .page.active-page.hero {
            display: flex;
        }

        /* AUTH PAGES */
        .auth-page {
            min-height: calc(100vh - 75px);
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            background: #f5f7fb;
        }

        .auth-page.active-auth {
            display: flex;
        }

        .auth-box {
            width: 430px;
            max-width: 100%;
            background: white;
            padding: 38px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
        }

        .auth-box h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .auth-box .auth-subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .auth-box .input-box {
            margin-bottom: 17px;
        }

        .auth-box .input-box input {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .auth-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #0066ff;
            color: white;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .auth-submit:hover {
            background: #004dcc;
        }

        .auth-switch {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .auth-switch a {
            color: #0066ff;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .auth-divider {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            color: #888;
        }

        .auth-divider::before,
        .auth-divider::after {
            content: "";
            height: 1px;
            background: #ddd;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .google-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 13px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: white;
            color: #222;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .google-btn:hover {
            background: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .auth-note {
            margin-top: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        body.dark .auth-page {
            background: #0f172a;
        }

        body.dark .auth-box {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: white;
        }

        body.dark .auth-box .auth-subtitle,
        body.dark .auth-note {
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        body.dark .auth-divider {
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        body.dark .auth-divider::before,
        body.dark .auth-divider::after {
            background: #475569;
        }

        body.dark .google-btn {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
            border-color: #475569;
        }

        /* MOBILE */
        @media (max-width: 800px) {

            .menu-btn {
                display: block;
            }

            nav {
                display: none;
                position: absolute;
                top: 70px;
                left: 0;
                width: 100%;
                background: #111827;
                flex-direction: column;
                padding: 25px;
            }

            nav.active {
                display: flex;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 40px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 17px;
            }

            .about {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .about-image {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    
/* ===== UNIQUE TECHZONE DESIGN OVERRIDE ===== */
:root{
 --tz-bg:#070b17;--tz-panel:#0e1528;--tz-white:#f8fafc;
 --tz-muted:#94a3b8;--tz-a:#7c3aed;--tz-b:#06b6d4;--tz-line:rgba(255,255,255,.10);
}
*{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
 font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
 background:#f7f8fc;color:#111827;
}
header{
 width:calc(100% - 28px);margin:14px;
 padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
 border-radius:22px;background:rgba(7,11,23,.88);
 backdrop-filter:blur(20px);box-shadow:0 15px 50px rgba(2,6,23,.22);
}
.logo{
 font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.8px;
 color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;
}
.logo:before{
 content:"TZ";display:grid;place-items:center;width:35px;height:35px;
 border-radius:11px;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--tz-a),var(--tz-b));
 box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(124,58,237,.35);
}
nav{gap:5px}
nav a{
 padding:10px 12px;border-radius:11px;color:#cbd5e1;
 font-weight:600;font-size:14px;
}
nav a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);color:#fff}
.dark-btn{
 color:#fff!important;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--tz-a),#4f46e5);
 border-radius:11px;padding:10px 13px;font-weight:700;
 transition:.25s;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(79,70,229,.22);
}
.dark-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);filter:brightness(1.1)}

.hero{
 min-height:calc(100vh - 10px);margin-top:-70px;padding:155px 7% 90px;
 position:relative;overflow:hidden;
 background:
 radial-gradient(circle at 16% 30%,rgba(6,182,212,.20),transparent 24%),
 radial-gradient(circle at 84% 25%,rgba(124,58,237,.25),transparent 28%),
 linear-gradient(135deg,#050816,#0c1430 52%,#111b3e);
}
.hero:before{
 content:"";position:absolute;width:520px;height:520px;right:-180px;bottom:-250px;
 border:1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.18);border-radius:50%;
 box-shadow:0 0 100px rgba(6,182,212,.10);
}
.hero-content{max-width:920px;position:relative;z-index:2}
.hero h1{
 font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,88px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-4px;
 margin-bottom:25px;color:#fff;
 background:linear-gradient(100deg,#fff,#67e8f9 45%,#c4b5fd);
 -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
}
.hero p{color:#b8c4d8;font-size:19px;line-height:1.8;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 34px}
.btn{
 border-radius:13px;padding:14px 22px;font-weight:800;
 background:#fff;color:#111827;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.20);
 transition:.25s;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
}
.btn:hover{
 transform:translateY(-3px);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--tz-a),#4f46e5);
 color:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 35px rgba(79,70,229,.30);
}

section{padding:95px 7%}
.title h2,.about-box h2{font-size:clamp(35px,5vw,50px);letter-spacing:-1.8px}
.title p{color:#64748b}
.about{gap:70px}
.about-box p{color:#64748b;line-height:1.9}
.about-image{
 min-height:390px;border-radius:30px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
 background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%,rgba(34,211,238,.24),transparent 25%),
 linear-gradient(135deg,#0b1224,#312e81);
 border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);box-shadow:0 25px 70px rgba(15,23,42,.18);
 font-size:100px;
}
.about-image:after{
 content:"DIGITAL • CREATIVE • RESPONSIVE";
 position:absolute;left:25px;right:25px;bottom:25px;padding:13px 15px;
 border-radius:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
 color:#dbeafe;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:800;
}

.services{
 background:radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%,rgba(124,58,237,.10),transparent 25%),#f1f5f9;
}
.cards{gap:22px}
.card{
 min-height:245px;padding:30px 25px;border-radius:23px;
 background:rgba(255,255,255,.82);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);
 box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(15,23,42,.07);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
 position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.card:before{
 content:"";position:absolute;width:110px;height:110px;right:-50px;top:-50px;
 border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(124,58,237,.14),rgba(6,182,212,.14));
}
.card:hover{
 transform:translateY(-9px);border-color:rgba(124,58,237,.35);
 box-shadow:0 25px 55px rgba(15,23,42,.13);
}
.icon{
 width:65px;height:65px;margin:0 auto 20px;border-radius:19px;
 display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:32px;
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ede9fe,#cffafe);
}
.card h3{font-size:21px}.card p{color:#64748b}

.service-page{background:#f7f8fc}
.service-detail{
 max-width:1050px;border-radius:28px;padding:48px;
 background:rgba(255,255,255,.90);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);
 box-shadow:0 25px 70px rgba(15,23,42,.10);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
}
.big-icon{
 width:85px;height:85px;margin:0 auto 20px;display:grid;place-items:center;
 border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ede9fe,#cffafe);
}
.service-detail .detail-item{
 padding:20px;border-radius:17px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;
 border-left:0;box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(15,23,42,.035);
}
.service-detail .detail-item strong{color:#6d28d9}
.how-it-works{
 padding:24px;border-radius:19px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#eef2ff);
}

.contact-form{
 padding:40px;border-radius:26px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);
 border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);box-shadow:0 25px 70px rgba(15,23,42,.10);
}
.input-box input,.input-box textarea{
 padding:15px;border-radius:13px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;
 transition:.2s;
}
.input-box input:focus,.input-box textarea:focus{
 border-color:#7c3aed;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(124,58,237,.10);background:#fff;
}
.submit-btn,.auth-submit{
 border-radius:13px!important;
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#4f46e5)!important;
 box-shadow:0 12px 25px rgba(79,70,229,.22);
 font-weight:800;
}

.auth-page{
 background:radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%,rgba(6,182,212,.12),transparent 25%),
 radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%,rgba(124,58,237,.14),transparent 28%),#f7f8fc;
}
.auth-box{
 border-radius:27px;padding:40px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.90);
 border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(15,23,42,.14);
 backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
}
.auth-box h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-1px}
.google-btn{border-radius:13px;transition:.2s}
.google-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(15,23,42,.08)}

footer{background:#050816;padding:55px 20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
footer h3{font-size:26px}
footer p{color:#94a3b8}
footer a{color:#67e8f9}

.modal{backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
.login-box{
 border-radius:24px;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);
 box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.30);
}

body.dark{background:#050816}
body.dark .services,body.dark .service-page{background:#080d1b}
body.dark .card,body.dark .contact-form,body.dark .service-detail,
body.dark .auth-box,body.dark .login-box{
 background:rgba(15,23,42,.90);color:#f8fafc;border-color:rgba(148,163,184,.13);
}
body.dark .card p,body.dark .about-box p,body.dark .title p,
body.dark .service-detail p,body.dark .auth-subtitle{color:#94a3b8}
body.dark .service-detail .detail-item{background:#0b1222;border-color:#1e293b}
body.dark .how-it-works{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b1222,#111827)}
body.dark .input-box input,body.dark .input-box textarea{background:#0b1222;color:#fff;border-color:#334155}
body.dark .google-btn{background:#0b1222;color:#fff;border-color:#334155}
body.dark .auth-page{background:#050816}

@media(max-width:800px){
 header{width:calc(100% - 20px);margin:10px;border-radius:17px}
 .hero{margin-top:-65px;padding:145px 20px 70px}
 .hero h1{font-size:48px;letter-spacing:-2.5px}
 .hero p{font-size:16px}
 section{padding:70px 20px}
 .about{gap:35px}.about-image{min-height:280px}
 .service-detail{padding:28px 18px}
 .contact-form{padding:28px 20px}.auth-box{padding:30px 22px}
 nav{padding:18px}
}


/* ===== TECHZONE V3 — PREMIUM AGENCY UI ===== */
:root{
  --tz-violet:#6d5dfc;
  --tz-purple:#8b5cf6;
  --tz-cyan:#22d3ee;
  --tz-ink:#070a14;
  --tz-soft:#f7f8fc;
  --tz-card:rgba(255,255,255,.82);
}
body{
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%,rgba(109,93,252,.08),transparent 28%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 100% 20%,rgba(34,211,238,.07),transparent 24%),
    var(--tz-soft);
}
header{
  position:fixed;
  left:50%;
  transform:translateX(-50%);
  top:16px;
  width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 28px));
  margin:0;
  padding:10px 12px 10px 18px;
  border-radius:18px;
  background:rgba(7,10,20,.82);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
  backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(140%);
  box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(2,6,23,.25);
}
.logo{
  font-size:23px;
  letter-spacing:-1px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:10px;
}
.logo:before{
  content:"";
  width:34px;height:34px;
  border-radius:11px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(135deg,var(--tz-cyan),var(--tz-violet) 55%,var(--tz-purple));
  box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(109,93,252,.38);
}
nav{gap:4px}
nav a{
  padding:9px 12px;
  border-radius:10px;
  font-size:13px;
  color:#cbd5e1;
}
nav a:hover{
  color:#fff;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);
}
.dark-btn{
  padding:9px 12px;
  border-radius:10px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--tz-violet),#4f46e5);
}

/* HERO */
.hero{
  min-height:100vh;
  margin-top:0;
  padding:170px 7% 95px;
  overflow:hidden;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 15% 30%,rgba(34,211,238,.16),transparent 22%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 83% 28%,rgba(109,93,252,.25),transparent 27%),
    linear-gradient(135deg,#050816 0%,#0b1025 50%,#11183b 100%);
}
.hero:before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  width:600px;height:600px;
  right:-260px;top:-150px;
  border-radius:50%;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  box-shadow:0 0 120px rgba(109,93,252,.12);
}
.hero:after{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  width:10px;height:10px;
  left:12%;top:26%;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--tz-cyan);
  box-shadow:
    130px 90px 0 rgba(139,92,246,.8),
    330px -50px 0 rgba(34,211,238,.65),
    510px 190px 0 rgba(139,92,246,.55);
}
.hero-content{
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
}
.hero h1{
  max-width:920px;
  margin:0 auto 24px;
  font-size:clamp(50px,7.5vw,88px);
  letter-spacing:-4px;
  line-height:.98;
  background:linear-gradient(105deg,#fff 18%,#a5f3fc 48%,#c4b5fd 78%);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
}
.hero p{
  color:#aab7cf;
  max-width:690px;
  font-size:18px;
  line-height:1.8;
}
.hero .btn:first-of-type{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--tz-cyan),#38bdf8);
  color:#06111c;
}
.hero .btn:first-of-type:hover{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--tz-violet),var(--tz-purple));
  color:#fff;
}

/* SECTION HEADINGS */
.title{margin-bottom:52px}
.title h2,.about-box h2{
  color:#0f172a;
  font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:-2px;
}
.title p{color:#64748b}

/* ABOUT */
.about{
  max-width:1180px;
  margin:auto;
}
.about-box{
  padding-right:20px;
}
.about-box p{
  color:#64748b;
  line-height:1.9;
}
.about-image{
  min-height:390px;
  border-radius:30px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.04),transparent),
    radial-gradient(circle at 25% 25%,rgba(34,211,238,.25),transparent 25%),
    linear-gradient(135deg,#080c1a,#211d50 60%,#082f49);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
  box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(15,23,42,.20);
  position:relative;
}
.about-image:before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  width:150px;height:150px;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
  border-radius:38px;
  transform:rotate(18deg);
}
.about-image:after{
  content:"BUILD • DESIGN • LAUNCH";
  left:25px;right:25px;bottom:22px;
  padding:13px 15px;
  border-radius:14px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  color:#dbeafe;
  font-size:10px;
  letter-spacing:2.4px;
  font-weight:800;
}

/* SERVICES */
.services{
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 15% 5%,rgba(109,93,252,.08),transparent 22%),
    #f1f4fa;
}
.cards{
  max-width:1180px;
  margin:auto;
  gap:20px;
}
.card{
  min-height:255px;
  padding:30px 26px;
  border-radius:24px;
  border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.17);
  background:var(--tz-card);
  backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
  box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(15,23,42,.065);
  transition:transform .28s ease,box-shadow .28s ease,border-color .28s ease;
}
.card:after{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  left:0;right:0;bottom:0;
  height:3px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--tz-cyan),var(--tz-violet));
  transform:scaleX(0);
  transform-origin:left;
  transition:.3s;
}
.card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-10px);
  border-color:rgba(109,93,252,.28);
  box-shadow:0 25px 60px rgba(15,23,42,.12);
}
.card:hover:after{transform:scaleX(1)}
.icon{
  width:64px;height:64px;
  border-radius:19px;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ede9fe,#cffafe);
  box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(109,93,252,.10);
}
.card h3{font-weight:800}
.card p{color:#64748b}

/* DETAIL PAGES */
.service-page{
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 10%,rgba(109,93,252,.08),transparent 25%),
    #f7f8fc;
}
.service-detail{
  border-radius:30px;
  border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);
  backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
  box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(15,23,42,.10);
}
.service-detail .detail-item{
  border-radius:17px;
  background:#f8fafc;
  border:1px solid #e7eaf0;
  border-left:0;
  transition:.2s;
}
.service-detail .detail-item:hover{
  transform:translateY(-3px);
  border-color:#c4b5fd;
  box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(109,93,252,.08);
}
.service-detail .detail-item strong{color:#6d5dfc}
.how-it-works{
  border-radius:19px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#eef2ff);
}

/* CONTACT + AUTH */
.contact-form,.auth-box{
  border-radius:28px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);
  border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18);
  box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(15,23,42,.10);
  backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
}
.input-box input,.input-box textarea{
  border-radius:13px;
  background:#f8fafc;
  border:1px solid #e2e8f0;
}
.input-box input:focus,.input-box textarea:focus{
  border-color:var(--tz-violet);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(109,93,252,.10);
}
.submit-btn,.auth-submit{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--tz-violet),#4f46e5)!important;
  border-radius:13px!important;
}
.google-btn{border-radius:13px}

/* MOBILE */
@media(max-width:800px){
  header{
    top:10px;
    width:calc(100% - 20px);
    padding:10px 14px;
  }
  .hero{
    padding:150px 20px 75px;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:48px;
    letter-spacing:-2.7px;
  }
  .hero p{font-size:16px}
  section{padding:72px 20px}
  .about{gap:35px}
  .about-image{min-height:280px}
  .service-detail{padding:28px 18px}
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo">TechZone</div>

        <div class="menu-btn" onclick="openMenu()">☰</div>

        <nav id="navbar">
            <a href="#" onclick="showPage('home'); return false;">Home</a>
            <a href="#" onclick="showPage('about'); return false;">About Us</a>
            <a href="#" onclick="showPage('services'); return false;">Services</a>
            <a href="#" onclick="showPage('contact'); return false;">Contact</a>

            <button class="dark-btn" id="themeBtn" onclick="toggleTheme()">🌙 Dark</button>

            <button class="dark-btn" onclick="openLogin()">
                Login
            </button>

            <button class="dark-btn" onclick="showAuthPage('signup')">
                Sign Up
            </button>
        </nav>
    </header>


    <!-- HOME -->
    <section class="hero page active-page" id="home">

        <div class="hero-content">

            <h1>Welcome To TechZone</h1>

            <p>
                Build your online presence with our modern,
                fast and responsive website solutions.
            </p>

            <a href="#" class="btn" onclick="showPage('services'); return false;">
                Explore Services
            </a>

            <button class="btn" onclick="openLogin()">
                Login
            </button>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ABOUT -->
    <section class="page" id="about">

        <div class="about">

            <div class="about-box">

                <h2>About Us</h2>

                <p>
                    Welcome to TechZone. We create modern and
                    responsive websites using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Our goal is to make websites that look beautiful
                    on laptops, tablets and mobile phones.
                </p>

                <a href="#" class="btn"
                   onclick="showPage('contact'); return false;"
                   style="background:#0066ff;color:white;">
                    Contact Us
                </a>

            </div>

            <div class="about-image">
                💻
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- SERVICES -->
    <section class="services page" id="services">

        <div class="title">

            <h2>Our Services</h2>

            <p>
                What we can do for you
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card" onclick="showService('web-development')">
                <div class="icon">🌐</div>
                <h3>Web Development</h3>
                <p>Modern and functional websites using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="showService('web-design')">
                <div class="icon">🎨</div>
                <h3>Web Design</h3>
                <p>Clean, attractive and user-friendly website layouts and interfaces.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="showService('responsive-design')">
                <div class="icon">📱</div>
                <h3>Responsive Design</h3>
                <p>Websites that automatically adjust to mobile, tablet and laptop screens.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="showService('ui-ux-design')">
                <div class="icon">✨</div>
                <h3>UI / UX Design</h3>
                <p>Simple user interfaces and smooth experiences that are easy to use.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="showService('ecommerce')">
                <div class="icon">🛒</div>
                <h3>E-Commerce</h3>
                <p>Online stores with product sections, shopping features and modern layouts.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="showService('website-maintenance')">
                <div class="icon">🛠️</div>
                <h3>Website Maintenance</h3>
                <p>Website updates, bug fixing, content changes and performance improvements.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="showService('seo')">
                <div class="icon">🔎</div>
                <h3>SEO Optimization</h3>
                <p>Basic search-engine-friendly structure, content and performance improvements.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="showService('landing-page')">
                <div class="icon">🚀</div>
                <h3>Landing Pages</h3>
                <p>Focused and attractive pages for products, businesses, campaigns and services.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="showService('javascript')">
                <div class="icon">⚡</div>
                <h3>JavaScript Features</h3>
                <p>Interactive buttons, forms, modals, navigation, validation and dynamic features.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>



    <!-- SERVICE DETAIL PAGES -->
    <section class="service-page" id="web-development">
        <div class="service-detail">
            <div class="big-icon">🌐</div>
            <h2>Web Development</h2>

            <p class="detail-intro">Web Development website ka complete functional structure banane ka process hai. Is mein HTML se structure, CSS se styling aur JavaScript se interactive functionality add ki jati hai.</p>

            <div class="detail-list">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>HTML Structure</strong>
                    <span>Website ke pages, headings, sections, forms aur content ka proper structure.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>CSS Styling</strong>
                    <span>Colors, spacing, cards, buttons, layouts aur visual appearance ko design karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>JavaScript</strong>
                    <span>Buttons, navigation, forms, modals, alerts aur dynamic features ko functional banana.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Navigation</strong>
                    <span>Home, About, Services aur Contact pages ke darmiyan smooth navigation.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Forms</strong>
                    <span>Contact aur login forms ke liye validation aur user interaction.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Interactive Features</strong>
                    <span>Dark mode, menus, service pages aur other clickable features.</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="how-it-works">
                <h3>How It Works</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li>Website ki requirements aur pages decide kiye jate hain.</li>
                    <li>HTML mein complete page structure banaya jata hai.</li>
                    <li>CSS se website ko professional design diya jata hai.</li>
                    <li>JavaScript se buttons aur interactive features run kiye jate hain.</li>
                    <li>Desktop aur mobile par testing ki jati hai.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <button class="btn back-btn"
                    onclick="showPage('services')"
                    style="background:#0066ff;color:white;">
                ← Back to Services
            </button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service-page" id="web-design">
        <div class="service-detail">
            <div class="big-icon">🎨</div>
            <h2>Web Design</h2>

            <p class="detail-intro">Web Design website ki look, feel aur visual presentation ko professional banata hai. Goal yeh hota hai ke website attractive bhi ho aur visitor ke liye easy bhi ho.</p>

            <div class="detail-list">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Layout</strong>
                    <span>Sections, columns, cards aur content ko clean arrangement mein place karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Colors</strong>
                    <span>Brand ke according suitable color combinations select karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Typography</strong>
                    <span>Readable fonts, headings aur text sizes ko properly set karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Buttons</strong>
                    <span>Clear aur attractive buttons with hover effects.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Cards</strong>
                    <span>Services, products aur information ko organized cards mein show karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Visual Experience</strong>
                    <span>Website ko modern, clean aur professional appearance dena.</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="how-it-works">
                <h3>How It Works</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li>Website ka visual structure plan kiya jata hai.</li>
                    <li>Colors, fonts aur spacing select ki jati hai.</li>
                    <li>Sections, cards aur buttons design kiye jate hain.</li>
                    <li>Desktop aur mobile layouts ko check kiya jata hai.</li>
                    <li>Final design ko website ke HTML/CSS mein implement kiya jata hai.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <button class="btn back-btn"
                    onclick="showPage('services')"
                    style="background:#0066ff;color:white;">
                ← Back to Services
            </button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service-page" id="responsive-design">
        <div class="service-detail">
            <div class="big-icon">📱</div>
            <h2>Responsive Design</h2>

            <p class="detail-intro">Responsive Design ka matlab hai ke website mobile, tablet, laptop aur desktop par properly adjust ho. Screen choti ya bari hone par layout automatically adapt karta hai.</p>

            <div class="detail-list">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Mobile Layout</strong>
                    <span>Small screens ke liye content ko single-column aur easy-to-read banana.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Tablet Layout</strong>
                    <span>Medium screens ke liye cards aur sections ko properly adjust karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Desktop Layout</strong>
                    <span>Large screens par multiple columns aur spacious layout use karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Flexible Images</strong>
                    <span>Images aur content ko screen ke according fit karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Responsive Menu</strong>
                    <span>Mobile par navigation ko compact menu mein convert karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Media Queries</strong>
                    <span>Different screen sizes ke liye CSS rules apply karna.</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="how-it-works">
                <h3>How It Works</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li>Desktop layout design kiya jata hai.</li>
                    <li>Mobile aur tablet screen sizes identify kiye jate hain.</li>
                    <li>CSS media queries aur flexible layouts add kiye jate hain.</li>
                    <li>Navigation aur cards ko responsive banaya jata hai.</li>
                    <li>Different devices par final testing ki jati hai.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <button class="btn back-btn"
                    onclick="showPage('services')"
                    style="background:#0066ff;color:white;">
                ← Back to Services
            </button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service-page" id="ui-ux-design">
        <div class="service-detail">
            <div class="big-icon">✨</div>
            <h2>UI / UX Design</h2>

            <p class="detail-intro">UI/UX Design website ke interface aur user experience ko simple aur useful banata hai. User ko website use karte waqt clear navigation aur easy interaction milta hai.</p>

            <div class="detail-list">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>User Interface</strong>
                    <span>Buttons, menus, cards, forms aur other visual controls design karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>User Experience</strong>
                    <span>Visitor ke liye website ka flow simple aur understandable banana.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Navigation</strong>
                    <span>Important pages aur information tak easy access dena.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Consistency</strong>
                    <span>Colors, buttons, fonts aur spacing mein consistent design rakhna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Accessibility</strong>
                    <span>Readable text aur clear controls ke zariye usability improve karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>User Flow</strong>
                    <span>Visitor ko page se page tak logical way mein guide karna.</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="how-it-works">
                <h3>How It Works</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li>User ko website par kya karna hai, woh identify kiya jata hai.</li>
                    <li>Pages aur navigation ka flow plan kiya jata hai.</li>
                    <li>Interface elements design kiye jate hain.</li>
                    <li>User-friendly spacing, colors aur typography apply ki jati hai.</li>
                    <li>Complete flow ko test karke improvements ki jati hain.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <button class="btn back-btn"
                    onclick="showPage('services')"
                    style="background:#0066ff;color:white;">
                ← Back to Services
            </button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service-page" id="ecommerce">
        <div class="service-detail">
            <div class="big-icon">🛒</div>
            <h2>E-Commerce</h2>

            <p class="detail-intro">E-Commerce service online store ke liye professional product aur shopping interface banane par focus karti hai. Customers ko products browse karne aur information samajhne mein asani hoti hai.</p>

            <div class="detail-list">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Product Cards</strong>
                    <span>Product image, name, price aur action button ko organized way mein show karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Categories</strong>
                    <span>Products ko different categories mein organize karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Product Details</strong>
                    <span>Product ke features, description aur pricing ko clearly display karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Cart Interface</strong>
                    <span>Shopping cart style interface jahan selected products show ho saken.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Search</strong>
                    <span>Products ko quickly find karne ke liye search interface.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Responsive Store</strong>
                    <span>Online store ko mobile, tablet aur desktop par usable banana.</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="how-it-works">
                <h3>How It Works</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li>Store ke products aur categories ka structure plan hota hai.</li>
                    <li>Product cards aur product detail layouts banaye jate hain.</li>
                    <li>Shopping buttons aur cart-style interactions add ki jati hain.</li>
                    <li>Responsive design apply ki jati hai.</li>
                    <li>Complete store interface ko test kiya jata hai.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <button class="btn back-btn"
                    onclick="showPage('services')"
                    style="background:#0066ff;color:white;">
                ← Back to Services
            </button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service-page" id="website-maintenance">
        <div class="service-detail">
            <div class="big-icon">🛠️</div>
            <h2>Website Maintenance</h2>

            <p class="detail-intro">Website Maintenance ka purpose existing website ko updated, functional aur clean rakhna hai. Problems ko fix karke website mein required changes kiye jate hain.</p>

            <div class="detail-list">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Bug Fixing</strong>
                    <span>Website ke broken buttons, layout problems aur JavaScript errors fix karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Content Updates</strong>
                    <span>Text, images, headings aur other content update karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Design Changes</strong>
                    <span>Colors, cards, sections aur layouts mein changes karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Feature Updates</strong>
                    <span>New buttons, pages ya interactive features add karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Mobile Fixes</strong>
                    <span>Mobile screens par layout aur navigation problems solve karna.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <strong>Performance</strong>
